OL,3,GNEWSAHospital trust makes extra
OL,4,A#675,000 from parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have criticised a hospital
OL,7,Ftrust's decision to raise parking
OL,8,Fcharges after figures showed it made
OL,9,Fmore than #675,000 extra last year.
OL,11,FUnited Lincolnshire Teaching Hospitals
OL,12,F(ULHT) generated #1,835,894 in parking
OL,13,Frevenue in 2025/26 - up #676,442, or
OL,14,F58%, from the #1,159,452 collected the
OL,15,Fyear before, according to figures from
OL,16,Fa Freedom of Information (FOI) request.
OL,18,FHealthwatch Lincolnshire said it was
OL,19,F"concerned" about the higher fees for
OL,20,Fpeople parking at Lincoln County,
OL,21,FBoston Pilgrim and Grantham and
OL,22,FDistrict hospitals.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
