OL,3,GNEWSAHospital trust makes extra
OL,4,A#675,000 from parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, ULTH said revenue from parking
OL,7,Fcharges "contributes to the wider work
OL,8,Fwe undertake to improve the experience
OL,9,Fof our patients, visitors and staff".
